# Minimal G4Cosmic/CORSIKA text shower list.
# Columns:
#   event_id  particle_id  x  y  z  px  py  pz  time
# Units are selected in the macro. The demo macro uses:
#   idScheme=corsika, positionUnit=m, momentumUnit=GeV, timeUnit=ns
#
# CORSIKA particle IDs used here:
#   1=gamma, 5=mu+, 6=mu-, 14=proton
#
# In the WarpTrack coordinate convention, negative pz points downward.
